> SRM, or just some of them.  I'm sure Wilko will give us the details. :-)

DAC960s. Aka RAIDarray230 controllers. KZPSC & KZPAC (IIRC). KZPAC was
UltraSCSI, the other one Fast SCSI.

The DEC cards had only one flash ROM which means you cannot go (much) higher
than 2.73 (IIRC again) firmware. 3.x etc needs more flash which these cards
dont have.

